    # in the tree had ever CALLED it.  Zero consumers, on the correlation
    # behind every K-value.  The check now lives on the BASE (Psat_Pa is
    # non-virtual and delegates to computePsat), so no model can forget it.
    # The corpus decided the message: 111 of 332 cases evaluate outside a
    # window, bimodally, and the big tail is combustion -- N2 at 2400 K
    # against Tc 126.2 K.  Above Tc there is no saturation curve to
    # extrapolate at all, so that case gets its own sentence; the branch is on
    # Tc, never on the size of the excursion.
    # Sabotage-verified twice: drop the noteRange call; collapse the two
