    # thermodynamics and nothing had ever compared them.  For a balanced
    # reaction the element terms cancel, so dG0 = SUM nu*(hfAq - T*sAq) and
    # logK follows exactly -- the same cancellation the electrolyte builder
    # already relies on.
    # First run: 2 of 77 derivable, BOTH agreeing to better than 0.01 log
